          "text": "Present Perfect: HAVE + past participle",
          "voice_line": "The Present Perfect. Formula: <emphasis level=\"strong\">HAVE</emphasis> or <emphasis level=\"strong\">HAS</emphasis> plus the past participle. Have eaten. Has gone. Have seen. Have you ever heard of it? You just used it.",
