          "type": "explanation",
          "text": "The superpower: connects past → RIGHT NOW",
          "voice_line": "Here is the <emphasis level=\"strong\">superpower</emphasis>. <break time=\"0.3s\"/> The Present Perfect connects the <emphasis level=\"strong\">past</emphasis> to right <emphasis level=\"strong\">now</emphasis>. The past action still matters in this moment. It is a <emphasis level=\"strong\">bridge</emphasis>. Not just history — current relevance.",
