          "text": "Feel the difference:",
          "voice_line": "Feel this difference. <break time=\"0.3s\"/> I ate lunch — simple past, that is just history. I have eaten lunch — present perfect, so do not offer me food right now. I lived in Paris — I moved away. I have lived in Paris — maybe I still do.",
